[Start "1. e4 c5 2. c3 Nf6 3. e5 Nd5 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nf3 Nc6 6. cxd4 d6 7. Bc4 Nb6 8. Bb5 dxe5 9. Nxe5"]

9... e6 $2 { Black develops, but the knight on c6 is pinned and its only guards are the pawn on b7 and the queen. } 10. Nxc6 $1 bxc6 ( 10... Qd5 11. Nc3 ) 11. Bxc6+ { The pawn that took on c6 is now the one in the way: this check wins the rook on a8. } 11... Bd7 12. Bxa8 Qxa8 13. O-O *
